---
const text = [
  'Goodison Park, home of Everton Football Club since 1892, is the first purpose built football stadium in the world.',
  'Paragraph #2',
  'Paragraph #3'
]
---
<div class="text">
  <p>Goodison Park, built as the home of Everton Football Club in 1892, became the first purpose built football stadium in the world.</p>
  <p>After 133 years, as the Everton men’s team now prepares to begin a new chapter at their new home at Bramley Moore Dock for the 2025 to 26 season, the stadium will become the home of Everton Women.</p>
  <p>As a lasting legacy to commemorate Goodison Park to date, we have archived and contextualized all fan clips captured over the years to create a digital place. This will be the first digital stadium, allowing fans to relive memories whenever they want.</p>
</div>
<button class="stage2-nav">
  [Enter]
</button>

<script>
let page = 1;
const nav = document.querySelector('.stage2-nav')!
const text = JSON.parse(nav.getAttribute('data-text') || '[]');
const stages = document.querySelector('.stages')!
document.addEventListener('stage2', () => {
  stages.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
    event.stopPropagation();
    event.stopImmediatePropagation();
    event.preventDefault();

    document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('splashcomplete', { bubbles: true }));
    return false;
  });
});
</script>

<style>
.title {
  grid-row: 2 / 3;
  text-transform: none;
}
.text {
  @mixin text;
  text-transform: none;
  text-align: center;
  grid-row: 4 / 5;
}
.stage2-nav {
  @mixin button;
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 20px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  appearance: none;
  background-color: transparent;
  border: none;
  color: white;
  cursor: pointer;
  grid-row: 6 / 7;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
</style>